# Local Rust build artifacts (native/ — see docker/Dockerfile's native-builder
# stage, which compiles fresh inside the container). Without this, a locally
# built wheel/target dir for the host's platform (e.g. macOS) gets copied into
# the build context and can shadow the freshly built Linux wheel.
native/target/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
